cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use JevGAG, please cite it as below."
title: "JevGAG: Jev-Grounded Adaptive Temporal Granularity for Causal Video Generation"
abstract: >-
  An image-grounded, off-device System One oracle (Jev 1.14) for adaptive temporal
  granularity in causal video generation, with a matched hardware/operating-point
  break-even law, recovery+hysteresis control, and a validated independent endpoint.
